6-8865-3386729ad138?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=651919abeea1bb21b70e148b1f361ffe 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I love your art very much! Can you please draw my character in your style? She is a demon pretending to be an angel nurse. She has blue hair with pink highlights and heart shaped top hair. You can change her hairstyle if you would like to, she has many hairstyles. Please make sure her skin tone is tanned please like her references. She can also change her eye color to blue and pink. She most commonly has heterochromia. She hide her pink eye behind a heart shaped eye patch a lot since it reveals she is a demon. Both eyes are pink in her demon form. Here is a link to the google drive with my character along with many outfits she has that you can choose to draw! Thank you!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Jd_42MQogvuLckGoZB3tz6MwtEYb5y31", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}